The Bascom Library invites you to participate in our community ofrenda for El Día de Muertos. El Día de Muertos isnbsp;anbsp;Mexican holiday and tradition that honors the dearly departed and celebrates life through death.nbsp;
Learn about El Día de Muertos and honor your loved ones who have passed. Bring a (copy only please)nbsp;photo of a loved one you wish to honor or write their name on a special name tag provided by staff.nbsp;
If you bring a photograph of a loved one, please be sure to pick it up by November 15.ADA Accommodation Requests
