Come join us to celebrate the Festival of Lights—Diwali!nbsp;
Immerse your family in an interactive Indian classical dance and storytelling program that brings the traditions, stories and spirit of Diwali to life through movement, music and audience participation.nbsp;Diwali tales brought to life through expressive Indian classical movement, music and rhythms andnbsp;concludes with a joyful group dance!
