Author Zandra Zuraw will discuss a practical low-waste approach to decorating for the holiday. Slow Style is a new way of practicing the art of decoration. Rather than focusing on the current product-driven approach to home design and decor, Slow Style shows you how to use what you already have, develop your eye for what works and what doesn't, and make choices that are truly connected to who you are
